# IQE-FC-001: Recent forecast jobs
# Lists the most recent time-series forecasting jobs with status and model.

foreach j in forecast.jobs
select j.id, j.source, j.context, j.input_rows, j.status, j.model_id, j.created_at
# Presentation (IQE has no `order by` or `limit`; the reader applies it): sort by j.created_at desc, keep the first 20 rows.
